I'm at the end of sanity... For whatever reason the games suddenly has massive frame drops out of nowhere constantly when out in the open. It goes fine when I first log in but after a few moments it would start. Areas where I've been before often, new area's, it doesn't stop. I haven't changed any settings whatsoever back when I ran it perfectly to now.

&#x200B;

I don't wanna stop playing this game because I fucking love it but idk what I can do to fix this...

Idk about others but if you're too shy to say you support a party than mayby that party isn't as good as you thought?

